[PF4] volatile loop done i=4194304 (expect 4194304) COUNTER-OK
[PF4] first=90 last=90
[PF4] memset-after-touch ok first=165 last=165
[PF4] all done
[init] run exited with code 0 (0 = all assertions passed)
```

**结论**：
- C 循环跨了同样约 **1024 次**按需补页 #PF，**完全正常**（计数走完、字节全对）
